Package: iriscan-express4-winboat-support
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3, coreutils, diffutils, sed, tar
Maintainer: IRIScan Express 4 Linux contributors
Description: Safe WinBoat integration tools for IRIScan Express 4
 Adds and removes only the IRIScan Express 4 QEMU USB passthrough argument.
 Package installation does not modify or restart WinBoat.
